Columns: tier ops variant case raw_input_rows allocation_calls total_requested_bytes owned_hash_copies matcher_visits.
Payload bytes are requested allocations and full requested sizes on each reallocation, not peak or retained bytes. Exclusions: query and existing haystack formatting/casefold, input creation, lane/detail/widget building, History fetch and wire.
